   "source": [
    "from transformers import pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "MODEL_ID = \"google/gemma-4-E2B-it\"\n",
    "\n",
    "pipe = pipeline(\n",
    "    task=\"any-to-any\",\n",
    "    model=MODEL_ID,\n",
    "    device_map=\"auto\",\n",
    "    dtype=\"auto\"\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "eqtJZPHPP1b5"
   },
   "source": [
    "Gemma 僅支援少數 `task` 生成設定。有關可用 `task` 設定的更多信息，請參閱 Hugging Face 管道 [task()](https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main/en/main_classes/pipelines#transformers.pipeline.task) 文件。有關使用 Pipeline 類別的更多信息，請參閱 Hugging Face [Pipelines](https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main/en/main_classes/pipelines) 文件。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "W8pRmlIqHvh2"
   },
   "source": [
    "### 執行文字生成\n",
    "\n",
    "在 `pipeline` 物件中載入並設定 Gemma 模型後，您可以將 prompt 傳送到模型。以下範例程式碼顯示了使用 `text` 參數的基本請求："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "MFXVitgPHvh2"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stderr",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Both `max_new_tokens` (=256) and `max_length`(=20) seem to have been set. `max_new_tokens` will take precedence. Please refer to the documentation for more information. (https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/main/en/main_classes/text_generation)\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "[{'input_text': '<|turn>user\\nroses are red<turn|>\\n<|turn>model\\n',\n",
       "  'generated_text': '<|turn>user\\nroses are red<turn|>\\n<|turn>model\\nThat\\'s a classic phrase, often used to highlight a contrast or a truth.\\n\\n**\"Roses are red\"** is a very popular, simple, and sweet arrangement.\\n\\nWhat would you like to do with this phrase? Are you looking for:\\n\\n1. **More rhymes or phrases?**\\n2. **A continuation of a thought?**\\n3. **Just appreciating the simplicity?**'}]"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 4,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "pipe(text=\"<|turn>user\\nroses are red<turn|>\\n<|turn>model\\n\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "Giv5MIymHvh2"
   },
   "source": [
    "### 使用 prompt 模板\n",
    "\n",
    "當產生具有更複雜的 prompting 的內容時，請使用 prompt 範本來建立您的請求。 prompt 範本可讓您指定來自特定角色（例如`user` 或`model`）的輸入，並且是管理與Gemma 模型的多輪聊天互動的必要格式。以下範例程式碼顯示如何為Gemma建置prompt範本："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "FijxO7MsHvh2"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "[{'input_text': [{'role': 'system',\n",
       "    'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'You are a helpful assistant.'}]},\n",
       "   {'role': 'user',\n",
       "    'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Roses are red...'}]}],\n",
       "  'generated_text': 'Roses are red,\\nViolets are blue,\\nHow lovely to see\\nA beautiful view.'}]"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 6,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from transformers import GenerationConfig\n",
    "config = GenerationConfig.from_pretrained(MODEL_ID)\n",
    "config.max_new_tokens = 512\n",
    "gen_kwargs = dict(generation_config=config)\n",
    "\n",
    "messages = [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"role\": \"system\",\n",
    "        \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"You are a helpful assistant.\"}]\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"role\": \"user\",\n",
    "        \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Roses are red...\"}]\n",
    "    },\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "pipe(messages, return_full_text=False, generate_kwargs=gen_kwargs)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "lKkJwXWkHvh2"
   },
   "source": [
    "<a name=\"vision\"></a>## 從圖像資料生成文本\n",
    "\n",
    "從 Gemma 3 開始，對於模型尺寸 4B 以上，您可以使用圖像資料作為 prompt 的一部分。本節介紹如何使用 Transformers library 載入和設定 Gemma 模型，以使用圖像資料和文字輸入產生文字輸出。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "VYP5Lr9SUVi5"
   },
   "source": [
    "### 使用 prompt 模板\n",
    "\n",
    "當產生具有更複雜的 prompting 的內容時，請使用 prompt 範本來建立您的請求。 prompt 範本可讓您指定來自特定角色（例如`user` 或`model`）的輸入，並且是管理與Gemma 模型的多輪聊天互動的必要格式。以下範例程式碼顯示如何為Gemma建置prompt範本："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "yVaqQ1IGU-FD"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "[{'input_text': [{'role': 'user',\n",
       "    'content': [{'type': 'image',\n",
       "      'url': 'https://ai.google.dev/static/gemma/docs/images/thali-indian-plate.jpg'},\n",
       "     {'type': 'text', 'text': 'What is shown in this image?'}]},\n",
       "   {'role': 'assistant',\n",
       "    'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'This image shows'}]}],\n",
       "  'generated_text': \" a platter of Indian food, likely a meal or an assortment of dishes.\\n\\nHere's a breakdown of what is visible:\\n\\n*   **Flatbread:** There is a large, golden-brown flatbread (possibly naan or roti) dominating the center of the platter.\\n*   **Dips/Sides:** There are several small bowls containing various accompaniments:\\n    *   A bowl of **yellow/mustard-colored dip** (perhaps a chutney or sauce).\\n    *   A bowl of **white creamy dip** (like raita or yogurt sauce).\\n    *   A portion of **white rice**.\\n    *   Several bowls of **curries or sauces** in different colors:\\n        *   An **orange/brown curry**.\\n        *   A **deep yellow/orange sauce**.\\n        *   A **green sauce** (likely a chutney).\\n*   **Garnish/Side Item:** In the upper right corner, there appears to be some darker, textured items, possibly fried pieces or spices.\\n*   **Platter:** The food is served on a metal platter.\\n\\nOverall, it looks like a traditional Indian meal setup featuring bread, rice, and various flavorful sauces/curries.\"}]"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 8,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from transformers import GenerationConfig\n",
    "config = GenerationConfig.from_pretrained(MODEL_ID)\n",
    "config.max_new_tokens = 512\n",
    "gen_kwargs = dict(generation_config=config)\n",
    "\n",
    "messages = [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"role\": \"user\",\n",
    "        \"content\": [\n",
    "            {\"type\": \"image\", \"url\": \"https://ai.google.dev/static/gemma/docs/images/thali-indian-plate.jpg\"},\n",
    "            {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"What is shown in this image?\"},\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"role\": \"assistant\",\n",
    "        \"content\": [\n",
    "            {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"This image shows\"},\n",
    "        ],\n",
    "    },\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "pipe(text=messages, return_full_text=False, generate_kwargs=gen_kwargs)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "wMgXjj0XRHdQ"
   },
   "source": [
    "您可以透過在 `content` 清單中新增 `\"type\": \"image\",` 條目，在 prompt 中新增多個圖像。\n",
    "> 注意：請勿在prompt 模板的文字部分中使用`<|image|>`、`<start_of_image>` 或`<image_soft_token>` tokens 模板，因為此方法會產生冗餘tokens 和處理錯誤。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
